 "release_convention": "Surveyed at Tuesday's close, published Friday 15:30 ET, so release_date_nominal = THE FRIDAY OF THE REPORT'S WEEK. Not a flat +3 days: the survey day shifts on holidays (2007-01-03 is a Wednesday because 2007-01-02 was the National Day of Mourning for President Ford). A study MUST key on release, not report -- keying on report_date is three days of look-ahead, exactly what R9 forbids of a conditioning variable.",
