 "micro_cot_inception_note": "A contract enters COT only once it has enough REPORTABLE traders, which is much later than its listing date -- the micros launched 2019-05-06 but MES first reports 2020-07-28 and MYM not until 2022-07-26. MSI and MHG have under a year of history. This BOUNDS the free weekly form of the proposal's rung 2: ES/MES and NQ/MNQ carry ~6 years, M2K ~4.7, MYM ~4, and the metal micros are unusable. Any micro/mini study must be scoped to the pairs that have history.",
